# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — CMake find_package(X11) 在 OHOS 上的变量注入 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-22
# Software: clipboard_lite 3.4
# Gate: conan-verify G2 链接失败 → 修正后 PASS
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv
#   4. Write knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     DRAFT-clipboard_lite-3.4-x11-cmake-injection
trigger_tool:           cmake|conan_create|ld
phase:                  configure|generate|linking
error_signature:        ld.lld: error: undefined symbol: XOpenDisplay|
                         undefined symbol: XDefaultScreen|
                         undefined symbol: XFixesQueryExtension|
                         X11/Xatom.h: file not found

severity:               3
category:               ohos, cmake, conan, x11, dependency-injection
match_keywords:         X11_INCLUDE_DIR, X11_LIBRARIES, find_package(X11), libx11,
                        xorgproto, libxfixes, libxtst, CMakeToolchain, Xatom.h,
                        Xfixes.h, XTest.h, .so file path, undefined symbol
title:                  CMake find_package(X11) 在 OHOS 上需注入 4 制品 include 拼接与 .so 文件路径

root_cause:             上游 CMakeLists.txt 用 find_package(X11 REQUIRED) 并消费
                        X11_INCLUDE_DIR / X11_LIBRARIES / X11_Xfixes_LIB /
                        X11_XTest_LIB；OHOS 无系统 X11 开发树，X11 头文件分属 4 个
                        Conan 制品：Xlib.h(libx11)、Xatom.h/X.h(xorgproto)、
                        Xfixes.h(libxfixes)、XTest.h(libxtst)。若 X11_LIBRARIES 只传
                        lib 目录，linker 忽略目录参数 → 大量 undefined symbol；
                        若 X11_INCLUDE_DIR 只传 libx11 的 include，Xatom.h
                        (xorgproto) 缺失 → file not found。

affected_scope:         OHOS 上一切 CMake 项目依赖 X11 头/库且上游用 find_package(X11)
                        的库（剪贴板/输入/窗口/X11 扩展客户端库等）。与 E480
                        (autotools/PKG_CHECK_MODULES + transitive_headers) 互补：
                        E480 管 configure/pkg-config 侧，本条管 CMake find_package(X11)
                        变量注入侧。

verification_cmd:       conan create archives/c/clipboard_lite/3.4 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           cmake-x11-variable-injection
rec_description:        conanfile.py generate() 中用 CMakeToolchain 注入：
                        tc.variables["X11_INCLUDE_DIR"] = ";".join(各依赖 include)（4 制品全列），
                        tc.variables["X11_LIBRARIES"] = <libx11>/lib/libX11.so（必须 .so 文件路径而非目录），
                        X11_Xfixes_LIB / X11_XTest_LIB 同理取实际 .so，
                        另设 CMAKE_LIBRARY_PATH 兜底 FindX11 的 find_library。
rec_command:            conan create archives/c/clipboard_lite/3.4 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conan-recipe
